        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Zaalima, Raees\n- People: Amitabh Bhattacharya, Arijit Singh, Harshdeep Kaur, Rahul Dholakia, Gauri Khan, Ritesh Sidhwani, Farhan Akhtar\n- Companies: Red Chillies Entertainment, Excel Entertainment\n- Concepts: Hindi songs, Indian films, crime action films\n\nFacts:\n- Raees is a 2017 Indian crime action film directed by Rahul Dholakia.\n- Raees was produced by Gauri Khan, Ritesh Sidhwani, and Farhan Akhtar under Red Chillies Entertainment and Excel Entertainment.\n- Zaalima is a Hindi song from the Indian film Raees.\n- Zaalima means Oppressor in English.\n- Zaalima was written by Amitabh Bhattacharya, composed by JAM8, and sung by Arijit Singh and Harshdeep Kaur.",
